WEBVTT

00:05:59.610 --> 00:06:03.527
will play an important role
in creating food security,

00:06:03.551 --> 00:06:07.113
seed sovereignty
and sustainable production

00:06:07.137 --> 00:06:12.318
in communities and countries that are
experiencing hunger and malnutrition.

00:06:12.924 --> 00:06:16.390
Having nutritious food
should not be a luxury.

00:06:16.916 --> 00:06:21.655
There is a need to ensure that there is
accessible and affordable nutritious food

00:06:21.679 --> 00:06:23.063
for everyone.

00:06:23.087 --> 00:06:26.423
And this is a step towards
making it a reality.

00:06:27.873 --> 00:06:29.023
Thank you.